ess|Pioneer Press]] | date=January 22, 2014 | access-date=February 3, 2014 | author=Salisbury, Bill | archive-date=February 22, 2014 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140222205250/http://blogs.twincities.com/politics/2014/01/22/frequent-candidate-davis-runs-for-governor-this-time-as-a-dfler/ | url-status=dead }}</ref><ref name="seifert">{{cite web | url=http://www.minnpost.com/party-politics/2013/11/marty-seifert-will-seek-gop-endorsement-governor | title=Marty Seifert will seek GOP endorsement for governor | work=[[MinnPost]] | date=November 12, 2013 | access-date=November 12, 2013 | author=Brucato, Cyndy}}</ref><ref name="thompson">{{cite web | url=http://www.startribune.com/politics/statelocal/213247731.html | title=GOP state Sen. Dave Thompson announces campaign for Minnesota governor | work=[[Star Tribune]] | date=June 27, 2013 | access-date=July 10, 2013 | author=Brooks, Jennifer}}</ref><ref name="zellers">{{cite news | url=http://www.startribune.com/politics/statelocal/212682041.html | title=GOP's Zellers vows common touch in Minn. governor's race, but brings past political baggage | agency=Associated Press | date=June 23, 2013 | access-date=July 10, 2013 | author=Condon, Patrick | archive-date=June 25, 2013 | archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20130625040830/http://www.startribune.com/politics/statelocal/212682041.html | url-status=dead }}</ref> Activist Leslie Davis sought the [[Minnesota Democratic–Farmer–Labor Party|DFL]] nomination.<ref name="davis" />

